xt-sky-100"><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>成交量接近近期平均（|z|&lt;2）</span></li></ul></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-200">近 N 根日線，收盤 900.00。</p></div><details class="group mt-3"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-300 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block text-xs transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-90">▸</span>詳細：七張指標卡與風險量測</summary><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-neutral-800 pt-3 text-xs text-neutral-400"><p>資料來源：demo_synthetic<span class="ml-1.5 rounded bg-neutral-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">快取資料，資料截至 2026-04-12（1 分鐘前取得，可能未含最近交易日）</span></p><p>資料來源：demo_synthetic<span class="ml-1.5 rounded bg-neutral-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">快取資料，資料截至 2026-04-12（1 分鐘前取得，可能未含最近交易日）</span></p><div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/40 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">指標速覽</h4><div class="mt-2"><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-sky-800 bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-100"><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>RSI 中區帶（30–70）</span></li><li><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-sky-800 bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-100"><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>K 值中區帶（20–80）</span></li><li><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-sky-800 bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-100"><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>%B 通道內（0–1）</span></li><li><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium border-sky-800 bg-sky-900/50 text-sky-100"><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>成交量接近近期平均（|z|&lt;2）</span></li></ul></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300">頁尾「技術分析」涵蓋本區資料來源、揭露事項與計算方式說明。</p></div><div><h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-400">技術指標</h4><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">移動平均線（MA5／MA20／MA60）</h4><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-400">近 N 日收盤價的簡單平均，用於觀察價格趨勢；三個天期分別各自判斷資料是否足夠，不以其他天期的數值代替。</p><div class="mt-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">MA5</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-200">905.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">MA20</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-200">906.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">MA60</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-200">904.00</p></div></div></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">RSI（14 日相對強弱指標）</h4><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-400">以近 14 日漲跌幅計算的動能數值，範圍 0–100，僅為數值觀察，不代表買賣訊號。</p><div class="mt-3"><p class="text-sm text-neutral-200">最新值：52.00</p><div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left text-xs text-neutral-400"><thead><tr class="border-b border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400"><th class="py-1 pr-3 font-normal">日期</th><th class="py-1 pr-3 font-normal">RSI</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="py-1 pr-3">2026-04-12</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">—</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1 pr-3">2026-04-13</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">—</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1 pr-3">2026-04-14</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">—</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1 pr-3">2026-04-15</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">—</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1 pr-3">2026-04-16</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-100">KD 隨機指標（9,3,3）</h4><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-400">收盤價於近期高低區間之相對位置，K、D 介於 0–100；僅為數值觀察。</p><div class="mt-3"><p class="text-sm text-neutral-200">K：50.00　D：48.00</p><div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto